    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/5986d48aa8fb084becd9ca7b08369f9a.poster.avif?t=1753799223\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/5986d48aa8fb084becd9ca7b08369f9a.webm?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/5986d48aa8fb084becd9ca7b08369f9a.mp4?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to be the first to hear the latest news about DODORI?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come hang out with us on Discord!</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/b46b11a31d647c1e0681ace74c428f77.avif?t=1753799223\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DODORI is a rhythm adventure game where you perform music along the lines of a rotating square. To create the ultimate performance, steady and passionate band practice is a must!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/dfc2138d1d9bc399f833e6af35b61805.poster.avif?t=1753799223\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/dfc2138d1d9bc399f833e6af35b61805.webm?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/dfc2138d1d9bc399f833e6af35b61805.mp4?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/9332508aa7a0962d814a58b007179555.avif?t=1753799223\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are only six days left until the festival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this year's festival feels different\u2014 Rumor has it a super famous band is coming to visit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But suddenly, your bandmates start handing in their resignation letters...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Sara, the vocalist of the Sowoon High School band, and it's up to you to bring the band back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/8e2db2d3f4f401f2f59410d856d6fef4.poster.avif?t=1753799223\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/8e2db2d3f4f401f2f59410d856d6fef4.webm?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/8e2db2d3f4f401f2f59410d856d6fef4.mp4?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/8592f3976a0c4409d56ffc493d152885.avif?t=1753799223\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DODORI isn\u2019t a serious game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right now, it's just a giant pudding(!), but many more fun and varied events are on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/0ea86f1596c072595d9ae77d026a7c36.poster.avif?t=1753799223\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/0ea86f1596c072595d9ae77d026a7c36.webm?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/0ea86f1596c072595d9ae77d026a7c36.mp4?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>At the heart of this game is always music\u2014</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>but maybe, just maybe,</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>music isn't the most important thing after all.</i></strong>\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/b46b11a31d647c1e0681ace74c428f77.avif?t=1753799223\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DODORI is a rhythm adventure game where you perform music along the lines of a rotating square. To create the ultimate performance, steady and passionate band practice is a must!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/dfc2138d1d9bc399f833e6af35b61805.poster.avif?t=1753799223\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/dfc2138d1d9bc399f833e6af35b61805.webm?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/dfc2138d1d9bc399f833e6af35b61805.mp4?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/9332508aa7a0962d814a58b007179555.avif?t=1753799223\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are only six days left until the festival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this year's festival feels different\u2014 Rumor has it a super famous band is coming to visit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But suddenly, your bandmates start handing in their resignation letters...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Sara, the vocalist of the Sowoon High School band, and it's up to you to bring the band back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/8e2db2d3f4f401f2f59410d856d6fef4.poster.avif?t=1753799223\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/8e2db2d3f4f401f2f59410d856d6fef4.webm?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/8e2db2d3f4f401f2f59410d856d6fef4.mp4?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/8592f3976a0c4409d56ffc493d152885.avif?t=1753799223\" width=616 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DODORI isn\u2019t a serious game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right now, it's just a giant pudding(!), but many more fun and varied events are on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/0ea86f1596c072595d9ae77d026a7c36.poster.avif?t=1753799223\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/0ea86f1596c072595d9ae77d026a7c36.webm?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903240/extras/0ea86f1596c072595d9ae77d026a7c36.mp4?t=1753799223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>At the heart of this game is always music\u2014</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>but maybe, just maybe,</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>music isn't the most important thing after all.</i></strong>\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "DODORI is a rhythm adventure game where you perform music along the lines of a rotating square. You play as Sara, the vocalist of the Soun High School band, working with your friends to create the ultimate performance. Enjoy DODORI, a high school girl band story with a unique emotional twist!",
